XMRIS V4.04 changes from 4.02

Imakefile tidied up more. It now unpacks out of the box into the X11/bin dir
and the stuff.

Doesn't enable debugging by default.

Tidied up some CONST stuff which was causing Linux to fail on compile.

Added a STATICDEBUG check to force static linking on debug, if
the architecture demands that.

Fixed a bug in the timing code, which caused xmris to seize up on
heavily loaded systems (thanks to Greg Hassan <gwhassan@cs.buffalo.edu>
for checking it worked).

Cursor made invisible on xmris window. Can be made visible
with "Xmris*cursorName" resource.
